<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>I Don't Like People (&amp; They Don't Like Me)</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Boston Manor</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Desperate Times, Desperate Pleasures</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4xBNejHCh7vBVb4m4lQD00</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作词: "},{"tx":"Henry Cox"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Ash Wilson"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Michael Cunniff"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Daniel Cunniff"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Jordan Pugh"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作曲: "},{"tx":"Henry Cox"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Ash Wilson"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Michael Cunniff"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Daniel Cunniff"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Jordan Pugh"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I haven’t left my bedroom for sixteen days.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I don’t see why I would do, when everything’s so grey.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">&amp; you can say whatever you like.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">There’s no way that I’m going outside</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Cause I don’t like people &amp; they don’t like me.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I’m a surface level freak, no one’s listening to me &amp; I think I’m alone.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">&amp; the walls are closing in, can’t remember where I’ve been &amp; I think I’m alone.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I’m a cynical criminal drifting through the liminal.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">In a black beanie.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Wish you could follow me, honestly, this week I got a lot of sleep.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But I’m still dreaming.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I’m a surface level freak, no one’s listening to me &amp; I think I’m alone.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">&amp; the walls are closing in, can’t remember where I’ve been &amp; I think I’m alone.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">&amp; you can say whatever you like.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">There’s no way that I’m going outside</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Cause I don’t like people &amp; they don’t like me.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I’m a surface level freak, no one’s listening to me &amp; I think I’m alone.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">&amp; the walls are closing in, can’t remember where I’ve been &amp; I think I’m alone.</p></div></body></tt>